# The back office is written against the existing Supabase project.
# Anon key only — never a service-role key: this bundle ships to a browser,
# where any visitor could read it. Admin reach comes from the signed-in
# account's admin_access row via caller_is_admin(), not from a stronger key.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
